Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't believe that this is the future that awaits me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.09,0:00:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me. The Organization's interfering with events again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.97,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.63,0:00:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying it's all the choice of Steins Gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I was careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.44,0:00:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when it all began, two weeks ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I have missed it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.57,0:00:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call you again if I survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,El. Psy. Kongroo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.96,0:01:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,652.5)\bord0\shad0}Two weeks ago
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.63,0:01:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello~
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that Hawaiian style, Daru?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not Hawaiian. It's LA.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.72,0:01:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,LA?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.77,0:01:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He mentioned it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.14,0:01:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris was invited to participate in a Rai-Net battle in America, so she invited us along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.53,0:01:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically, the federal government wants the power of the great Hououin Kyouma on its side!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.45,0:01:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wild delusions, fail as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.42,0:01:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's a message from Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.38,0:01:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She says that the research she's working on is almost done, so she can come along!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.63,0:01:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like she wants you to come too, Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.43,0:01:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.85,0:02:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,"Okabe doesn't have to come though. It's not like I want to see him or anything."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a true tsundere. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.81,0:02:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Future Gadget Laboratory could definitely use a foothold for global expansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin's a tsundere too, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,America? Don't bother coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me something back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you like, Moeka?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:36.43,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\c&HB5AEB0&\frx4\fry2\frz17.585\pos(1044,76.5)\fax.05}From: {\c&HFDFFFF&}Shin{ing Fingers}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:33.59,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\frx2\fry0\frz18.993\pos(1197,141)\fax.05}Macadamia \Nnuts x6
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:36.43,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs45\frz19.571\t(0,700,\frz17.526)\fax.05\clip(m 753 1008 l 1542 715.5 1257 19.5 498 264)\move(1351.5,775.5,1101,81,0,700)}...anything but that.\NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Some sweets would be sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.25,0:03:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, I would need to keep this secret...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.59,0:03:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I am mad scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,United States. Chaos and invade!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mad scientist?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a small citizen. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.66,0:03:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand? Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Kyouma...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,To think the Organization would join forces with the federal government in a bid to stop me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you haven't changed, Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.92,0:03:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! I thought it was my \Nexperiment-loving assistant, Christina.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.68,0:04:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not your assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you may have been an agent of the Organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a walking failure. I have to do something...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wild delusions, fail as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.94,0:04:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.99,0:04:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit blabbering. Let's get going already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.07,0:04:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.95,0:04:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're driving?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Lukako...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.21,0:04:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Go call a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so out of breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.40,0:04:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,For the taxi fare.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:04:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.15,0:05:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.28,0:05:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.37,0:05:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you cancel the hotel I booked?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't let the Organization know about our plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, is it the Seven Kings of North America?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. The Seven's Philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.51,0:05:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A Japan vs. America battle already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But we must avoid pointless conflicts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If I must, I will use the secret Desert Night!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.27,0:05:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me you've already mastered it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come! A distant 8770 kilometers from home, I announce it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.70,0:05:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Until my body breaks and my soul passes on to Valhalla,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.99,0:05:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall fight valiantly in the Ragnarok!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you have quite the nice room for an assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.05,0:06:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys can stay here until you find somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.18,0:06:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just do as you please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just drink what you please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She's asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.03,0:06:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've seen this scene before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This really is the most relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.37,0:06:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how much do you love labs?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.87,0:06:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How's life over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing has really changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't end up writing any \Npapers on time machines, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you mentioned something before about a different worldline.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems there might be others who have\N memories of other worldlines, just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.60,0:07:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I only remember you saving me at Radio Kaikan, and then trying to find you to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.11,0:07:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure that's all you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you found something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,T-This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a motel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Later then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.73,0:07:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to just leave us here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got no choice. With your budget, motels are the only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Motels are where aliens take over people's bodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.04,0:08:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're where hockey-masked lunatics butcher people!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't confuse reality and fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late for that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that you see those kind of things in the movies, but it's still scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.39,0:08:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be too much for Mayuri and Urushibara alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be fine staying with Okarin. We used to sleep together often when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.11,0:08:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Together?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.36,0:08:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you imagining?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear her say it was when we were kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.07,0:08:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.49,0:08:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, the girls and guys shouldn't share a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Urushibara—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a guy, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, I'll stay here with you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.67,0:08:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe and Hashida are together. I'll stay with Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? I have to stay all by myself? It's scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.14,0:08:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Hashida can stay alone, and I'll stay with Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.98,0:08:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That leaves Okabe and—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind, if it's with Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.31,0:09:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But, he's a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So, in the end, Makise ended up alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.65,0:09:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's no problem with Lukako and Mayuri staying together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Lesbianism is in the air. Ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even imagine it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it's lesbian in the other room, then this room is—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.71,0:09:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.33,0:09:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.96,0:09:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's decide with rock-paper-scissors which one of us sleeps in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.77,0:09:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I let him have my sleeping place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.81,0:09:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The Supah Hakah is my important right-hand man, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So you lost in rock-paper-scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And why are you still up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.86,0:09:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just thinking a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.61,0:10:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you come in? Just for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.23,0:10:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to ask you about a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is Diet Dr Pepper!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.87,0:10:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring some home as souvenirs. \NWith the current exchange rate, it's cheaper here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.29,0:10:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what did you want to ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.71,0:10:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it about the Organization? Or perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're going to joke, just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.05,0:11:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard you say that before...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Another story, another worldline. Don't mind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.64,0:11:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I wanted to ask about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.31,0:11:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I'm not all that sure about your theory of worldlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But just as you said, I've dreamed of things I haven't experienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, I had a dream where I was trying to cheer you up on a bridge in Akihabara.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've dreamed about using the whiteboard while trying hard to explain something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.21,0:11:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've dreamed about fixing your lab coat in some dark place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.09,0:11:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as I thought. You still have some of your memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So those were real?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.18,0:11:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether they're real or not is hard to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They may as well be dreams to you in this worldline.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.31,0:11:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But they really happened in some other worldlines?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.78,0:11:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.36,0:12:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I have another question...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.62,0:12:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I had another... weird dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,One where you and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.46,0:12:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.25,0:12:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.42,0:12:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need to go to the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.44,0:12:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin and Kurisu sure do get along well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This decides it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.62,0:12:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a virus card! Faris wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris! Faris! Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:13:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A male beauty on stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.97,0:13:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.65,0:13:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.57,0:13:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the "Nyan Nyan"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.74,0:13:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.95,0:13:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistant, you're supposed to be a Japanese maid in America spreading our glorious culture!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember anyone saying anything about that! \NAnd I don't want to do that either!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.21,0:13:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We agreed to work here to pay for the plane tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.38,0:13:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only natural for a lab mem to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.71,0:13:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't recall having someone else pay for my ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Lab mems are one soul, one body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you do it too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have so much energy,\N I guess you slept well last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.89,0:13:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It seemed like something was bothering you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.40,0:13:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just a bit curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.99,0:14:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not really it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.20,0:14:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then just forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.49,0:14:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing good can come out of \Nremembering other worldlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.29,0:14:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.25,0:14:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd planned to forget it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.83,0:14:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.85,0:14:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzuha?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzuha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Suzuha here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The last thing she said to me was...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.29,0:14:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Thank you. I'll see you in seven years."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:15:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The time machine hasn't been invented in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She can't exist here until she's born in seven years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And yet, she's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.51,0:15:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is there a time machine in this worldline too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.60,0:15:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If that's true, it may mean World War III.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Okabe is gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.69,0:15:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He seemed to be in a panic,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.28,0:15:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and then I saw him go outside and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.15,0:15:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.95,0:15:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I just heard that someone looking like him got in a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? I wonder if something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.25,0:15:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just the usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.25,0:15:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.25,0:15:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why you followed me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you aren't her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.42,0:15:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I just entered the Rai-Net tournament and am going to Las Vegas with my friends who live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.10,0:15:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But, for you to follow me all the way here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.31,0:16:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,she must be really important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This girl I look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.99,0:16:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.36,0:16:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a precious friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.99,0:16:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know where she is now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.49,0:16:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.58,0:16:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But, I'll see her again in seven years. Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.67,0:16:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite the wonderful story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.84,0:16:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,A fortune teller told me that I'll get \Nmarried and have a kid in seven years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.59,0:16:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.02,0:16:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for taking up your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.98,0:16:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. I had fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.94,0:16:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.53,0:16:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:16:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seven years from now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course she wouldn't know what I was talking about...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,$0.67 left. The battery's dead too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.35,0:17:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to get back?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.10,0:17:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That was how it all started, two hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.20,0:17:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.96,0:17:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit! I can't let it end here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.22,0:17:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the mad scientist, Hououin Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.15,0:18:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Not in a place like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.11,0:18:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't even been able to tell her properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.91,0:18:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.63,0:18:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,An illusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.55,0:18:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the reality as your brain interprets it \Nfrom the signals sent through your retinas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.31,0:18:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.40,0:18:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're going to come searching for me, \Nthen at least check the gas before you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.57,0:18:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:18:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.99,0:18:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What about your cell phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.74,0:18:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.58,0:18:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your phone battery's dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,you have a total of 67 cents,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.58,0:19:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and you were about to die lying face down in the middle of the highway!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.33,0:19:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear it from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.96,0:19:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It was unavoidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.71,0:19:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I had seen an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.59,0:19:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,An old friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.18,0:19:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So it wasn't anything I needed to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.89,0:19:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.02,0:19:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That I'd forget it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.23,0:19:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.07,0:19:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act like it's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very important to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Important?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.83,0:19:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said... It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.04,0:19:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember how I said I had another weird dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.46,0:19:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.67,0:19:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too realistic to be just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.26,0:19:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.47,0:19:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.51,0:20:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, it's real. To me, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.35,0:20:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.76,0:20:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you that I loved you in another worldline.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.48,0:20:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.94,0:20:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.07,0:20:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.20,0:20:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We may have spent a lot of time together in another worldline,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.29,0:20:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but those times are all dreams to me in this worldline.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.71,0:20:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So... it's very confusing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.30,0:20:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I possess the Reading Steiner, so I remember everything from the other worldlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.64,0:20:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The three weeks I spent with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it was a much, much longer time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.90,0:20:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I know because I was with you all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.24,0:21:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In any worldline, any time, any place, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.29,0:21:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll say it properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.95,0:21:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise Kurisu, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.96,0:21:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Here and now, how do you feel about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.63,0:21:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.76,0:24:24.99,Typeset,,0,0,0,,{\bord15\1a&FFF&\q1}MUWAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.10,0:22:11.52,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(150,150)}Even the billions of heartbeats in the world
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.52,0:22:18.19,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(150,150)}are nothing to you but insignificant
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.19,0:22:23.28,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(150,150)}Whether we’re trapped in the past or lamenting over the future
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.28,0:22:29.33,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(150,150)}predetermination does not allow even the slightest mistake
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.33,0:22:35.33,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(150,150)}The infinite dreams and futures before us
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.33,0:22:41.26,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(150,150)}are but vain privileges allowed to us
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.26,0:22:47.43,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(150,150)}Finitude is what both clock hands show
